{"parse": {"title": "Void Knights' Reward Options", "pageid": 367463, "revid": 15351002, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs=Commendation Rewards}}\n{{Infobox Shop\n|name = Void Knights' Reward Options\n|image = [[File:Void Knights' Reward Options.png|300px]]\n|release = [[18 April]] [[2006]]\n|update = Pest Control\n|members = Yes\n|icon = no\n|location = [[Void Knights' Outpost]]\n|owner = [[Void Knight]]\n|special = [[Pest Control]] rewards\n|map = {{Map|name=Void Knight|x:2654,y:2663|x:2659,y:2665|x:2662,y:2649|x:2662,y:2653|plane=0|mapID=0|mtype=pin|bucket=yes}}\n|leagueRegion = Asgarnia\n}}\nThe '''Void Knights' Reward Options''' is the rewards shop for the [[Pest Control]] minigame, accessed by talking to any [[Void Knight]]. At the rewards shop, players can use [[Void Knight commendation points|commendation points]] earned by completing rounds of Pest Control to purchase experience, [[Void Knight equipment]], and various resource packs.\n\nAfter completing the [[Hard Western Provinces Diary]], points can also be used by speaking to an [[Elite Void Knight]] to upgrade a [[Void knight top]] or [[Void knight robe|robe]] to an [[elite void top]] or [[elite void robe]], for 200 points each. Pieces of Void Knight equipment can be sold back to the [[Dodgy Squire]] for 80% of their original value in commendation points.\n\n==Experience rewards==\nPlayers can exchange commendation points for [[experience]] in any combat skill that is equal to or greater than level 25.\n\n'''Bonus''' experience is awarded for trading in large amounts of points at once. If a player trades in 10 points at once, they get an extra 1% experience; for 100 points at once, they get an extra 10% experience.\n<tabber>\n|-|1 point at once=\n{| class=\"wikitable align-center-1\" style=\"text-align:right;\"\n! rowspan=\"2\" |Points\n! rowspan=\"2\" |Level\n! colspan=\"3\" |Experience\n|-\n!{{SCP|Attack}} / {{SCP|Strength}} / {{SCP|Defence}} / {{SCP|Hitpoints}}\n!{{SCP|Ranged}} / {{SCP|Magic}}\n!{{SCP|Prayer}}\n|-\n|1\n|25-34\n|35\n|32\n|18\n|-\n|1\n|35-42\n|70\n|64\n|36\n|-\n|1\n|43-48\n|105\n|96\n|54\n|-\n|1\n|49-54\n|140\n|128\n|72\n|-\n|1\n|55-59\n|175\n|160\n|90\n|-\n|1\n|60-64\n|210\n|192\n|108\n|-\n|1\n|65-69\n|245\n|224\n|126\n|-\n|1\n|70-73\n|280\n|256\n|144\n|-\n|1\n|74-77\n|315\n|288\n|162\n|-\n|1\n|78-81\n|350\n|320\n|180\n|-\n|1\n|82-84\n|385\n|352\n|198\n|-\n|1\n|85-88\n|420\n|384\n|216\n|-\n|1\n|89-91\n|455\n|416\n|234\n|-\n|1\n|92-94\n|490\n|448\n|252\n|-\n|1\n|95-97\n|525\n|480\n|270\n|-\n|1\n|98-99\n|560\n|512\n|288\n|}\n|-|10 points at once=\n{| class=\"wikitable align-center-1\" style=\"text-align:right;\"\n! rowspan=\"2\" |Points\n! rowspan=\"2\" |Level\n! colspan=\"3\" |Experience\n|-\n!{{SCP|Attack}} / {{SCP|Strength}} / {{SCP|Defence}} / {{SCP|Hitpoints}}\n!{{SCP|Ranged}} / {{SCP|Magic}}\n!{{SCP|Prayer}}\n|-\n|10\n|25-34\n|353.5\n|323.2\n|181.8\n|-\n|10\n|35-42\n|707\n|646.4\n|363.6\n|-\n|10\n|43-48\n|1,060.5\n|969.6\n|545.4\n|-\n|10\n|49-54\n|1,414\n|1,292.8\n|727.2\n|-\n|10\n|55-59\n|1,767.5\n|1,616\n|909\n|-\n|10\n|60-64\n|2,121\n|1,939.2\n|1,090.8\n|-\n|10\n|65-69\n|2,474.5\n|2,262.4\n|1,272.6\n|-\n|10\n|70-73\n|2,828\n|2,585.6\n|1,454.4\n|-\n|10\n|74-77\n|3,181.5\n|2,908.8\n|1,636.2\n|-\n|10\n|78-81\n|3,535\n|3,232\n|1,818\n|-\n|10\n|82-84\n|3,888.5\n|3,555.2\n|1,999.8\n|-\n|10\n|85-88\n|4,242\n|3,878.4\n|2,181.6\n|-\n|10\n|89-91\n|4,595.5\n|4,201.6\n|2,363.4\n|-\n|10\n|92-94\n|4,949\n|4,524.8\n|2,545.2\n|-\n|10\n|95-97\n|5,302.5\n|4,848\n|2,727\n|-\n|10\n|98-99\n|5,656\n|5,171.2\n|2,908.8\n|}\n|-|100 points at once=\n{| class=\"wikitable align-center-1\" style=\"text-align:right;\"\n! rowspan=\"2\" |Points\n! rowspan=\"2\" |Level\n! colspan=\"3\" |Experience\n|-\n!{{SCP|Attack}} / {{SCP|Strength}} / {{SCP|Defence}} / {{SCP|Hitpoints}}\n!{{SCP|Ranged}} / {{SCP|Magic}}\n!{{SCP|Prayer}}\n|-\n|100\n|25-34\n|3,850\n|3,520\n|1,980\n|-\n|100\n|35-42\n|7,700\n|7,040\n|3,960\n|-\n|100\n|43-48\n|11,550\n|10,560\n|5,940\n|-\n|100\n|49-54\n|15,400\n|14,080\n|7,920\n|-\n|100\n|55-59\n|19,250\n|17,600\n|9,900\n|-\n|100\n|60-64\n|23,100\n|21,120\n|11,880\n|-\n|100\n|65-69\n|26,950\n|24,640\n|13,860\n|-\n|100\n|70-73\n|30,800\n|28,160\n|15,840\n|-\n|100\n|74-77\n|34,650\n|31,680\n|17,820\n|-\n|100\n|78-81\n|38,500\n|35,200\n|19,800\n|-\n|100\n|82-84\n|42,350\n|38,720\n|21,780\n|-\n|100\n|85-88\n|46,200\n|42,240\n|23,760\n|-\n|100\n|89-91\n|50,050\n|45,760\n|25,740\n|-\n|100\n|92-94\n|53,900\n|49,280\n|27,720\n|-\n|100\n|95-97\n|57,750\n|52,800\n|29,700\n|-\n|100\n|98-99\n|61,600\n|56,320\n|31,680\n|}\n</tabber>\n\nThe formula, which this table is based on, is as shown below. The amounts are awarded per commendation point traded in.\n\n<math>\\begin{align}\nExp &= \\left\\lfloor\\frac{Level^2}{600}\\right\\rfloor \\times N\n\\end{align}</math>\n\nwhere\n*<math>Exp</math> is experience gained,\n*<math>Level</math> is current level of that skill (should be at least 25),\n*The factor <math>N</math>:\n**If the skill is Prayer: <math>N=18</math>\n**If the skill is Magic or Ranged: <math>N=32</math>\n**If the skill is Attack, Strength, Defence or Hitpoints: <math>N=35</math>\n*The <math>\\lfloor\\quad\\rfloor</math> indicate that the expression should be rounded down to the nearest whole number.\n\n==Stock==\n===Items===\n{{#vardefine:cbreqs|{{SCP|Attack}}{{SCP|Strength}}{{SCP|Defence}}{{SCP|Hitpoints}}{{SCP|Ranged}}{{SCP|Magic|42}}<br />{{SCP|Prayer|22}}}}\n{{#vardefine:herbPack|{{#expr:\n{{GEP|Grimy harralander}}*(2+4)/2+\n{{GEP|Grimy ranarr weed}}*(2+3)/2+\n{{GEP|Grimy toadflax}}*(1+4)/2+\n{{GEP|Grimy irit leaf}}*(2+4)/2+\n{{GEP|Grimy avantoe}}*(1+4)/2+\n{{GEP|Grimy kwuarm}}*(1+5)/2\n}}}}\n{{#vardefine:mineralPack|{{#expr:\n{{GEP|Coal}}*25+\n{{GEP|Iron ore}}*18\n}}}}\n{{#vardefine:seedPack|{{#expr:\n{{GEP|Magic seed}}*3*1*1/1061+\n{{GEP|Yew seed}}*3*1*8/1061+\n{{GEP|Maple seed}}*3*1*10/1061+\n{{GEP|Willow seed}}*3*1*20/1061+\n{{GEP|Acorn}}*3*1*30/1061+\n{{GEP|Ranarr seed}}*3*1*20/1061+\n{{GEP|Sweetcorn seed}}*3*3*120/1061+\n{{GEP|Strawberry seed}}*3*2*90/1061+\n{{GEP|Limpwurt seed}}*3*2*100/1061+\n{{GEP|Watermelon seed}}*3*2*90/1061+\n{{GEP|Tomato seed}}*3*6*110/1061+\n{{GEP|Cabbage seed}}*3*9*100/1061+\n{{GEP|Onion seed}}*3*11*100/1061+\n{{GEP|Potato seed}}*3*14*200/1061+\n{{GEP|Snape grass seed}}*3*2*60/1061+\n{{GEP|Celastrus seed}}*3*1*0.5/1061+\n{{GEP|Redwood tree seed}}*3*1*0.5/1061\n}}}}\n\n{{StoreTableHead|currency=Void Knight commendation points|hidege=y|hidebuy=y|hidestock=y|hiderestock=y|hidecaption=y|column1 = Buy requirement|column2 = Notes}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void Knights' Reward Options#Herb pack|displayname=Herb pack|image=Guam leaf.png|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=30|buy=N/A|column1={{SCP|Herblore|25}}|column2=Contains a random assortment of noted grimy [[herb]]s.<br />Unlike the Nightmare Zone, these herb packs '''can''' be bought by ironmen.}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void Knights' Reward Options#Mineral pack|displayname=Mineral pack|image=Coal.png|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=15|buy=N/A|column1={{SCP|Mining|25}}|column2=Contains 25 noted [[coal]] and 18 noted [[iron ore]].}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void Knights' Reward Options#Seed pack|displayname=Seed pack|image=Banana tree seed 5.png|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=15|buy=N/A|column1={{SCP|Farming|25}}|column2=Contains a random amount of seeds, typically giving lower-tiered seeds.}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void knight mace|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=250|buy=N/A|column1={{#var:cbreqs}}|column2=Can cast and [[autocast]] [[Claws of Guthix]] in place of a [[Guthix staff]].<br/>'''Not''' required for the [[Void set effect]].}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void knight top|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=250|buy=N/A|column1={{#var:cbreqs}}|column2=Required for the [[Void set effect]].}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void knight robe|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=250|buy=N/A|column1={{#var:cbreqs}}|column2=Required for the [[Void set effect]].}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void knight gloves|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=150|buy=N/A|column1={{#var:cbreqs}}|column2=Required for the [[Void set effect]].}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void mage helm|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=200|buy=N/A|column1={{#var:cbreqs}}|column2=One helmet is required for the [[Void set effect]].<br/>+45% [[Magic]] accuracy.}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void ranger helm|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=200|buy=N/A|column1={{#var:cbreqs}}|column2=One helmet is required for the [[Void set effect]].<br/>+10% [[Ranged]] accuracy and damage.}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void melee helm|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=200|buy=N/A|column1={{#var:cbreqs}}|column2=One helmet is required for the [[Void set effect]].<br/>+10% [[Melee]] accuracy and damage.}}\n{{StoreLine|name=Void seal|stock=inf|restock=N/A|gemw=no|sell=10|buy=N/A|column1=N/A|column2=Worn in the amulet slot. Operate in a Pest Control game to inflict 8-12 points of damage to surrounding pests.}}\n{{StoreTableBottom}}\n\n====Elite upgrade====\nThe [[Elite Void Knight equipment|elite void]] upgrades cost 200 points each, for a total of 400 points, unlocked after completing the [[Hard Western Provinces Diary]].\n\n{{Uses material list|Void Knight commendation points}}\n\n====Herb pack====\nThe herb pack is worth {{coins|{{#var:herbPack}}}} on average. It costs 30 points, valued at {{coins|{{#expr:{{#var:herbPack}}/30}}}} per point,  and rewards the following [[herb]]s in varying amounts:\n\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Herb pack|leagueRegion=Asgarnia}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy harralander|quantity=2-4 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy ranarr weed|quantity=2-3 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy toadflax|quantity=1-4 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy irit leaf|quantity=2-4 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy avantoe|quantity=1-4 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Grimy kwuarm|quantity=1-5 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n====Mineral pack====\nThe mineral pack is worth {{coins|{{#var:mineralPack}}}}. It costs 15 points, valued at {{coins|{{#expr:{{#var:mineralPack}}/15}}}} per point, and rewards the following items:\n\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Mineral pack|leagueRegion=Asgarnia}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Coal|quantity=25 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Iron ore|quantity=18 (noted)|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n====Seed pack====\nThe seed pack is worth {{coins|{{#var:seedPack}}}} on average. It costs 15 points, valued at {{coins|{{#expr:{{#var:seedPack}}/15}}}} per point, and rewards three rolls of the following assortment of farming seeds:\n\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Seed pack|leagueRegion=Asgarnia}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Spirit seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=1/1061|raritynotes={{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1415011996693585920|date=13 July 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/96340|archivedate=15 July 2021|quote=Out of 1061...|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Magic seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=1/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Yew seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=8/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Maple seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=10/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Willow seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=20/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Acorn|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=30/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Ranarr seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=20/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Sweetcorn seed|rolls=3|quantity=3|rarity=120/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Strawberry seed|rolls=3|quantity=2|rarity=90/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Limpwurt seed|rolls=3|quantity=2|rarity=100/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Watermelon seed|rolls=3|quantity=2|rarity=90/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Tomato seed|rolls=3|quantity=6|rarity=110/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Cabbage seed|rolls=3|quantity=9|rarity=100/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Onion seed|rolls=3|quantity=11|rarity=100/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Potato seed|rolls=3|quantity=14|rarity=200/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Snape grass seed|rolls=3|quantity=2|rarity=60/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Celastrus seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=0.5/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Redwood tree seed|rolls=3|quantity=1|rarity=0.5/1061|raritynotes={{NamedRef|name=\"seeds\"}}}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 16 April 2015\n|update = Clan Wars Game Modes & More\n|poll = Old School Content Poll 31: Easter Holiday Event\n|change = The cap on Pest Control points has been raised from 250 to 4000.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 5 March 2015\n|update = Achievement Diaries\n|poll = Old School Achievement Diary Rewards Poll\n|change = The [[void knight top]] and [[void knight robe]] can now be upgraded to the [[elite void top]] and [[elite void robe]] for 200 [[Pest Control]] points each after completing the [[Hard Western Provinces Diary]].\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Pest Control}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:35.774814+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"ite